    "detailed_description": "Xenotech Arena is a Roguelite arena shooter set in Neo-Japan inspired arena.<br />\r\nA variety of characters such as Geisha Girl, Ninja Head, and Sumo Rider are playable.<br />\r\nChoose and collect over 70 different power-up items to enhance your player!<br />\r\nIf you can get class change items, you can evolve and further enhance your players.<br />\r\nTake on screen-filling monsters with your enhanced character and enjoy the exhilarating experience of tackling and blasting them!<br />\r\nCollect items in dungeon mode and see how long you can survive in arena mode!",
    "about_the_game": "Xenotech Arena is a Roguelite arena shooter set in Neo-Japan inspired arena.<br />\r\nA variety of characters such as Geisha Girl, Ninja Head, and Sumo Rider are playable.<br />\r\nChoose and collect over 70 different power-up items to enhance your player!<br />\r\nIf you can get class change items, you can evolve and further enhance your players.<br />\r\nTake on screen-filling monsters with your enhanced character and enjoy the exhilarating experience of tackling and blasting them!<br />\r\nCollect items in dungeon mode and see how long you can survive in arena mode!",
